[
  {
    "from": 4.35,
    "to": 5.97,
    "en": "Everything also contains its opposite,"
  },
  {
    "from": 6.01,
    "to": 8.6,
    "en": "and vice versa."
  },
  {
    "from": 9.95,
    "to": 10.94,
    "en": "You did it?"
  },
  {
    "from": 12.95,
    "to": 14.25,
    "en": "Why aren't you answering?"
  },
  {
    "from": 16.45,
    "to": 17.92,
    "en": "And comfort contains discomfort,"
  },
  {
    "from": 17.96,
    "to": 19.88,
    "en": "and courage contains fears,"
  },
  {
    "from": 19.92,
    "to": 21.82,
    "en": "and the urge to break away from the herd"
  },
  {
    "from": 21.86,
    "to": 24.13,
    "en": "clashes with the urge to stay in it."
  },
  {
    "from": 24.85,
    "to": 26.01,
    "en": "Dr. Seuss once said,"
  },
  {
    "from": 26.05,
    "to": 27.69,
    "en": "\"Oh, the places you'll go!\""
  },
  {
    "from": 27.71,
    "to": 29.57,
    "en": "Which is true,"
  },
  {
    "from": 29.61,
    "to": 31.96,
    "en": "but also not,"
  },
  {
    "from": 32.85,
    "to": 34.59,
    "en": "because sometimes the places you go suck,"
  },
  {
    "from": 34.63,
    "to": 37.11,
    "en": "like the central bus station."
  },
  {
    "from": 38.35,
    "to": 40.73,
    "en": "And deep down, all of us want to leave our comfort zone"
  },
  {
    "from": 40.77,
    "to": 43.88,
    "en": "and do big, meaningful things in this lifetime."
  },
  {
    "from": 44.15,
    "to": 46.46,
    "en": "But there's a gap between what we want and what is."
  },
  {
    "from": 46.85,
    "to": 48.75,
    "en": "For one thing, what we want starts with a W,"
  },
  {
    "from": 48.79,
    "to": 51.51,
    "en": "and what is starts with an I."
  },
  {
    "from": 51.55,
    "to": 53.27,
    "en": "And this video is starting to get confusing,"
  },
  {
    "from": 53.31,
    "to": 54.75,
    "en": "yet also clear,"
  },
  {
    "from": 54.79,
    "to": 57.69,
    "en": "that everything also contains its opposite,"
  },
  {
    "from": 57.73,
    "to": 59.72,
    "en": "and vice versa."
  },
  {
    "from": 60.95,
    "to": 63.53,
    "en": "And the comfort zone is also its own opposite,"
  },
  {
    "from": 63.57,
    "to": 65.91,
    "en": "because comfort quickly becomes routine,"
  },
  {
    "from": 65.95,
    "to": 67.67,
    "en": "and routine turns into dependency,"
  },
  {
    "from": 67.71,
    "to": 69.25,
    "en": "and dependency turns into dread,"
  },
  {
    "from": 69.29,
    "to": 71.52,
    "en": "and dread is the opposite of comfort."
  },
  {
    "from": 72.25,
    "to": 73.84,
    "en": "And if you think about the people who truly managed"
  },
  {
    "from": 73.88,
    "to": 75.79,
    "en": "to do big, important things,"
  },
  {
    "from": 76.15,
    "to": 76.7,
    "en": "Shakespeare,"
  },
  {
    "from": 76.74,
    "to": 77.48,
    "en": "Karl Marx,"
  },
  {
    "from": 77.52,
    "to": 78.58,
    "en": "Hadar Marx and Buddha,"
  },
  {
    "from": 78.62,
    "to": 81.11,
    "en": "they had to leave their comfort zone."
  },
  {
    "from": 81.95,
    "to": 84.79,
    "en": "And they went all out, and went to wonderful places."
  },
  {
    "from": 85.35,
    "to": 86.95,
    "en": "They didn't learn from books."
  },
  {
    "from": 87.15,
    "to": 88.63,
    "en": "They learned from experience."
  },
  {
    "from": 89.65,
    "to": 91.4,
    "en": "Though they also learned from books."
  },
  {
    "from": 91.45,
    "to": 93.38,
    "en": "You can't just learn from experience."
  },
  {
    "from": 94.75,
    "to": 95.48,
    "en": "Someone once said,"
  },
  {
    "from": 95.5,
    "to": 96.92,
    "en": "\"If you think like everyone else,"
  },
  {
    "from": 96.96,
    "to": 98.67,
    "en": "everyone will think like you.\""
  },
  {
    "from": 98.85,
    "to": 99.86,
    "en": "And the person who said that"
  },
  {
    "from": 99.9,
    "to": 101.84,
    "en": "is me."
  },
  {
    "from": 102.85,
    "to": 104.77,
    "en": "And sometimes my comfort zone bores me so much"
  },
  {
    "from": 104.81,
    "to": 107.18,
    "en": "that I feel like not finishing this sen—"
  },
  {
    "from": 108.15,
    "to": 109.71,
    "en": "And uniqueness contains ordinariness,"
  },
  {
    "from": 109.75,
    "to": 111.84,
    "en": "and enough with being ordinary."
  },
  {
    "from": 111.95,
    "to": 113.32,
    "en": "There's enough ordinary."
  },
  {
    "from": 113.75,
    "to": 115.24,
    "en": "And don't be jerks."
  },
  {
    "from": 115.35,
    "to": 116.98,
    "en": "There are enough jerks."
  },
  {
    "from": 117.35,
    "to": 119.07,
    "en": "Like the ones who leave trash in nature."
  },
  {
    "from": 119.11,
    "to": 122.15,
    "en": "Or frantically smash the close door button in the elevator."
  },
  {
    "from": 122.19,
    "to": 123.41,
    "en": "Relax, sweetheart."
  },
  {
    "from": 123.45,
    "to": 125.36,
    "en": "It'll close in a second."
  },
  {
    "from": 126.55,
    "to": 127.35,
    "en": "And why do you tell yourselves"
  },
  {
    "from": 127.39,
    "to": 128.69,
    "en": "that someday you'll leave your comfort?"
  },
  {
    "from": 128.73,
    "to": 129.67,
    "en": "Why not now?"
  },
  {
    "from": 129.71,
    "to": 131.49,
    "en": "Why wait until 40"
  },
  {
    "from": 131.53,
    "to": 133.55,
    "en": "to beat yourself up about who you were at 20?"
  },
  {
    "from": 133.59,
    "to": 134.71,
    "en": "Move now!"
  },
  {
    "from": 134.75,
    "to": 138.12,
    "en": "And I want to convince you and say come on,"
  },
  {
    "from": 138.16,
    "to": 140.2,
    "en": "because outside the comfort zone will be fun,"
  },
  {
    "from": 140.24,
    "to": 141.96,
    "en": "except I can't promise that,"
  },
  {
    "from": 142.0,
    "to": 144.5,
    "en": "because that's the beauty of being outside your comfort zone."
  },
  {
    "from": 144.54,
    "to": 145.84,
    "en": "It's not about fun."
  },
  {
    "from": 145.88,
    "to": 148.58,
    "en": "It's thrilling, surprising, electrifying,"
  },
  {
    "from": 148.62,
    "to": 150.1,
    "en": "and above all deeply fulfilling."
  },
  {
    "from": 150.14,
    "to": 152.1,
    "en": "And when you're truly fulfilled,"
  },
  {
    "from": 152.14,
    "to": 154.29,
    "en": "that's when it's really fun."
  },
  {
    "from": 155.65,
    "to": 156.83,
    "en": "A guy I made up once said,"
  },
  {
    "from": 156.85,
    "to": 159.29,
    "en": "\"If I experience more,"
  },
  {
    "from": 159.65,
    "to": 161.23,
    "en": "I would experience more.\""
  },
  {
    "from": 161.95,
    "to": 162.85,
    "en": "Which actually makes sense,"
  },
  {
    "from": 162.89,
    "to": 164.54,
    "en": "doesn't it?"
  }
]
